WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.973 --> 00:00:12.954
Okay. We need to get to work.

2
00:00:14.294 --> 00:00:18.997
Bello: School!

3
00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:23.139
Tina: He’s going to get us in trouble.

4
00:00:23.159 --> 00:00:25.640
Brad: We need to do something with him.

5
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.541
Bello: Boo!

6
00:00:27.561 --> 00:00:29.262
Danny: Okay, Bello.

7
00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.084
Just go over there and play in the corner.

8
00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:37.853
Brad: And what is he supposed to play with?

9
00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:40.074
Danny: Uh, I don’t know.

10
00:00:40.094 --> 00:00:42.135
Tina: I’ve got an idea.

11
00:00:42.576 --> 00:00:43.496
I’ll be right back!

12
00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.397
Danny: Don’t get caught!

13
00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:50.720
Brad: We should put paper over the windows and the door.

14
00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.861
Danny: That’s right.

15
00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:55.162
Or somebody will see Bello.

16
00:00:56.243 --> 00:00:59.044
Brad: This might take us a while.

17
00:00:59.064 --> 00:01:02.346
Danny: Oh no, it won’t.

18
00:01:03.087 --> 00:01:04.147
Bello, come here.

19
00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.522
Hold the paper like this.

20
00:01:10.542 --> 00:01:12.964
Danny: See?

21
00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:15.785
It’s pretty good having a giant around!

22
00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:19.407
Brad: Wow, that was quick.

23
00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:24.771
Tina: This is the best I could do!

24
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:27.092
Danny: It’s worth a try.

25
00:01:27.112 --> 00:01:29.253
Tina: Here you go, Bello.

26
00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:30.454
What do you think?

27
00:01:39.477 --> 00:01:40.177
Bello: Ball.

28
00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:42.759
Tina: I think he likes it!

29
00:01:42.779 --> 00:01:44.741
Danny: Good job, Tina!

30
00:01:44.761 --> 00:01:46.362
Brad: Okay.

31
00:01:46.663 --> 00:01:48.104
Let’s figure out what to do.

32
00:01:48.124 --> 00:01:52.448
Danny: There’s going to be a problem when we get back to Ginormous.

33
00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:54.069
Tina: Tristay?

34
00:01:54.349 --> 00:01:56.531
Brad: He’s definitely a problem.

35
00:01:56.551 --> 00:01:59.574
Danny: I was thinking about his evil helpers.

36
00:01:59.594 --> 00:02:01.415
Brad: Oh yeah.

37
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:03.757
They captured us pretty easily.

38
00:02:03.777 --> 00:02:06.900
Danny: We have to find a way to defeat them.

39
00:02:07.772 --> 00:02:09.933
Tina: Otherwise, we’ll never get to Tristay.

40
00:02:09.953 --> 00:02:11.773
Danny: That’s right.

41
00:02:12.893 --> 00:02:15.054
So what’s the best plan of attack?

42
00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:16.634
Tina: They’re big.

43
00:02:17.115 --> 00:02:17.955
They’re strong.

44
00:02:18.595 --> 00:02:19.475
They can fly.

45
00:02:19.495 --> 00:02:22.876
Danny: But we have our imaginations.

46
00:02:24.356 --> 00:02:25.817
Brad: Hey, look around.

47
00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:27.217
Where are we?

48
00:02:27.237 --> 00:02:31.498
Tina: We’re in an art classroom.

49
00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.419
Brad: That’s right!

50
00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:37.300
I’ll bet that Tristay’s evil helpers don’t like art!

51
00:02:37.684 --> 00:02:38.665
Danny: Great idea!

52
00:02:39.505 --> 00:02:41.166
We’ll scare them with color!

53
00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:43.388
They won’t know what hit them.

54
00:02:43.408 --> 00:02:46.270
Danny: Tina, you gather some paint.

55
00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:49.252
Brad, get some more modeling clay.

56
00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:50.573
Brad: You bet.

57
00:02:50.753 --> 00:02:54.795
Danny: And me I’ll get some crayons.

58
00:02:57.937 --> 00:03:02.160
Danny: Uh who was that?

59
00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.362
Tina: I’m here.

60
00:03:04.382 --> 00:03:06.263
Brad: I’m here.
